。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 六场景三方案实际运行，逐项保存预期/实际、输入/输出哈希、规则/环境、定位与映射核对；比较器在算法执行后读取标签。\n- [ ] 预期标签不由系统结果反推；各基线与本系统材料一致、描述符正确，有输入使用说明与可重复命令。\n- [ ] 报表有全样本分母、状态比较/混淆记录、失败/partial/弃判和明确可测目标；困难样本不删除，不把失败随意全计为FP。\n- [ ] P/R/F1适用时可根据明列TP/FP/FN复算；零分母N/A，无可测目标时说明不可测。\n- [ ] 实际耗时、资源观测方法及人工候选准备成本单列；没有观测到的指标标未测，不填猜测值。\n- [ ] GKD案例单列为既有真实链路记录，注明原生成版本和政策未核验；不计算商业App全局召回，不称本轮重跑。\n- [ ] 结果不理想或弃判较多仍如实交付；工程测试总数、六场景数量、真实App案例分别统计。\n\n## Out of Scope\n\n不评自动政策抽取准确率，不强制进行人工修正后第二轮实验；产品可选备注不构成签字门槛。六个小场景不作统计代表性宣称。\n\n## Blocked by\n\n#16。PT-910已是#16的传递前置，不再增加重复直接阻塞；S1案例#15已关闭。\n\n<!-- privacytrace-plan:2026-10-10:PT-903 -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrEcho114/PrivacyTrace/issues/25/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrEcho114/PrivacyTrace/issues/25/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Conn